runs from Feb 19, 2025 to Jun 27, 2025.","setup":"The stock rose about 50% in the three months before the base. It then formed a base for about 6 weeks, peaking at $118.07 and pulling back 26% at its deepest. Daily price ranges stayed about the same width through the base.","outcome":"On May 8, 2025 it closed at $120.75, its first close above the base high of $118.07. Volume that day was 3.2M shares, 0.59x the prior 10-day average of 5.5M. It didn't hold. By May 30, 2025 it had closed below the breakout level three days running, and the chart ends at $98.43.","lesson":"This is an example of a false breakout. Volume on the breakout day was light, and that tell was visible before the move fell apart. Cutting it early was a good read."}}